OL,3,AIndia 'cockroach' party says its
OL,4,Aleaders detained ahead of march
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice refused permission for the
OL,7,Fprotest, citing fears of a repeat of
OL,8,Fviolence seen at earlier demonstrations
OL,10,FThe CJP began as a satirical online
OL,11,Fcampaign before growing into a
OL,12,Fyouth-led movement
OL,14,FIts last major protest in July saw
OL,15,Fviolent clashes with police and forced
OL,16,FIndia's education minister to resign
